{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-02-17 07:00:00', 'title': 'LEADING AUSTRALIAN WEALTH FIRM SELECTS BROADRIDGE TO GROW SECURITIES FINANCE BUSINESS', 'text': "LONDON, SYDNEY AND NEW YORK, FEB. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO ASSIST IN OPTIMISING THEIR SECURITIES FINANCE OFFERING,\xa0 FINCLEAR , THE LEADING WEALTH MANAGEMENT INFRASTRUCTURE PROVIDER IN AUSTRALIA, HAS SELECTED BROADRIDGE\xa0FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE:BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER. BROADRIDGE'S SECURITIES FINANCE AND COLLATERAL MANAGEMENT (SFCM) FASTSTART SOLUTION PROVIDES FINCLEAR AND ITS CLIENTS WITH ENHANCED FUNCTIONALITIES IN THIS AREA OF THE BUSINESS."}